Package: waydesk
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: José Mendonça <jmendonca@gmail.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: waydesk-server (= @VERSION@), waydesk-desktop (= @VERSION@)
Description: Waydesk: a Windows-like remote Linux desktop over RDP
 Installs the RDP server (waydesk-server) and the desktop for its sessions
 (waydesk-desktop) in one step.
 .
 Waydesk builds on the sway compositor and is not part of the sway project.
